			"notes": "- Black and brown bears are animals of their own now, each with its own spawn egg; the polar bear's egg hatches polar bears again.\n- Each bear has a body of its own: the black bear tall-eared with a tan muzzle, the brown bear with a shoulder hump, a grizzled back and long pale claws.\n- Cubs are drawn as small copies of their parents.\n- Bears from earlier versions become the new animals the next time they load, keeping their health, age, name, and whether they were settled or kept.\n- Players without Pandorical see a polar bear of the right size, called a Black Bear or Brown Bear.\n- Needs Pandorical 15.20 or newer."
